---
import PhaseLayout from '../../layouts/PhaseLayout.astro';
---

<PhaseLayout title="100-Day Challenges — Polymath.Sys" activeNav="challenges">

<style>
  .ch-hub-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr)); gap:1.2rem; margin-top:2rem; }
  .ch-hub-card { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.6rem; padding:1.4rem 1.6rem; border:1px solid #222; text-decoration:none; color:inherit; transition:background 0.15s; }
  .ch-hub-card:hover { background:#f7f7f7; }
  .ch-hub-num { font-family:monospace; font-size:11px; color:#bbb; letter-spacing:0.1em; }
  .ch-hub-title { font-size:15px; font-weight:700; color:#111; letter-spacing:-0.01em; }
  .ch-hub-sub { font-size:12px; color:#666; line-height:1.6; }
  .ch-hub-meta { font-family:monospace; font-size:10px; color:#aaa; margin-top:0.4rem; }
  .ch-hub-arrow { font-size:18px; color:#ccc; margin-top:auto; padding-top:0.8rem; }
</style>

  <div class="track-header">
    <div class="track-badge badge-dsa">5 Tracks &middot; 500 Days of Deliberate Practice</div>
    <div class="track-title">100-Day Challenges</div>
    <div class="track-sub">Five intensive 100-day programs. Each designed to take you from beginner to practitioner in a specific domain through daily practice, concrete projects, and measurable milestones. Pick one track, commit fully, and do not stop until day 100.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="ch-hub-grid">
    <a href="/challenges/cs-se" class="ch-hub-card">
      <div class="ch-hub-num">01</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-title">100 Days of CS &amp; Software Engineering</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-sub">From programming fundamentals to capstone integration. 50 projects covering data structures, algorithms, OOP, databases, OS, system design, web dev, and DevOps.</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-meta">100 days &middot; 50 projects &middot; Full CS/SE Stack</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-arrow">&#8250;</div>
    </a>
    <a href="/challenges/ai-ml-dl" class="ch-hub-card">
      <div class="ch-hub-num">02</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-title">100 Days of AI / ML / Deep Learning</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-sub">From Python data basics to deploying production ML systems. Classical ML, deep learning, computer vision, NLP, transformers, generative AI, LLMs, and MLOps.</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-meta">100 days &middot; 50 projects &middot; Zero to Production AI</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-arrow">&#8250;</div>
    </a>
    <a href="/challenges/polymath" class="ch-hub-card">
      <div class="ch-hub-num">03</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-title">100 Days of the Polymath</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-sub">Mathematics, physics, CS theory, electronics, quantum computing, biology, robotics, finance, and philosophy — all connected through computation and first principles.</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-meta">100 days &middot; 50 projects &middot; Cross-Domain Mastery</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-arrow">&#8250;</div>
    </a>
    <a href="/challenges/competitive-programming" class="ch-hub-card">
      <div class="ch-hub-num">04</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-title">100 Days of Competitive Programming</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-sub">Structured progression from Codeforces rating 800 to 2000+. Greedy, DP, graphs, number theory, string algorithms, advanced data structures, and contest simulation.</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-meta">100 days &middot; 300+ problems &middot; CF 800 to 2000+</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-arrow">&#8250;</div>
    </a>
    <a href="/challenges/system-design" class="ch-hub-card">
      <div class="ch-hub-num">05</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-title">100 Days of System Design</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-sub">One system per day. Building blocks, classic internet systems, advanced distributed systems, and frontier architectures including ML platforms and LLM infrastructure.</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-meta">100 days &middot; 100 systems &middot; Architecture Mastery</div>
      <div class="ch-hub-arrow">&#8250;</div>
    </a>
  </div>

</PhaseLayout>
